  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "玩家初始8点行动力，但每花1点就给所有敌人1点；击杀又能回收行动力继续连动",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "You start your turn with 8 Action points but spending one grants it to each enemy . The more you act, the more your opponents will react! Thankfully, eliminating your foes also grants you action points, allowing for potentially devastating turns for you…or against you.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807090/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "战斗发生在患者潜意识中，关键记忆受损会强化怪物甚至重塑整张地图",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In Wantless, the fight does not take place on a battlefield, but within the subconscious of your patients. Proceed with caution, safeguard key memories and avoid instability at all costs. Failing to do so will empower the creatures or even modify the whole map.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807090/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "100多种突触可自定义技能效果、形状、消耗与冷却，170多项心智树节点以强力换副作用",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Use the synapses you've collected during your runs to craft your skills, experimenting with effects, shapes, costs and cooldowns! Combine damage, ailments, buffs, environmental effects, utility and more to create impressive combos. With 100+ synapses available, create a truly personalized build. Shape Eiris further by navigating the intricate Mind Tree, with more than 170 perks to choose from. However, be mindful of your choices, as the more powerful the nodes, the greater the drawbacks.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1807090/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
